# No Cursor Co-authorship

Never add Cursor (or any AI assistant) as a commit co-author.

Do **not** include trailers like:

```
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Co-authored-by: Cursor
```

Commit messages must contain only the human author's attribution as produced by git/config — no `Co-authored-by` lines for Cursor or other AI tools.
